    ],
    "summary": "Yes: a unit's abilities keep working while it is [embarked](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in a **TRANSPORT**, within the limits each ability sets. An embarked unit counts as Not On The Battlefield, under 01.02.04, so an ability that needs [visibility](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) of another unit, or a measurement to one, fails.\n\nFor example, Azrael leads an Intercessor Squad embarked in a **TRANSPORT** that shoots with [Firing Deck](vsdata:core-ability/firing-deck). The Supreme Grand Master ability of Azrael stays active but has no effect, because it works on weapons carried by models in his unit, while under Firing Deck the **TRANSPORT** counts as the one equipped with them.",
